@startuml
title Replay log review and cleanup

start
:Imported or locally registered log has status claim;
:Review task claims replay and fingerprint\n(ownership is separate from status);
:Read optional managed JSONL, retained diagnostics,\nand linked validated map;
:Record examined checkpoint after actual examination;
:Save analysis and proposals in Markdown;
:Record done for this review task;
if (Other active reviewers?) then (yes)
  :Keep status claim, optional JSONL, and manifest record;
else (no)
  :Mark log done;
  if (Record has managed JSONL?) then (yes)
    :Verify managed path and output checksum;
    :Delete JSONL;
  endif
  :Delete manifest record;
  :Retain map file, registration and replay association;
  :Retain retired fingerprint to prevent reimport;
endif
stop

@enduml
